       'Apply the standard to the facts step by step: for revenue, the five steps (contract, performance obligations, transaction price, allocation, recognition); for a lease, identified asset, substantially all the economic benefits, right to direct use; for a provision, present obligation, probable outflow, reliable estimate.',
